        <mxCell id="d7-sub" value="Blue = exists today, reused.   White with orange border = extended.   Orange dashed = new.   Grey dashed = only if the benchmark passes." style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5A6B7A;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
